<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:30.083" end="00:00:34.375" style="s2">- A Warm Cage -</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.580" end="00:00:59.740" style="s2">Let&#39;s keep it clean this time.</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.040" end="00:01:07.260" style="s2">We&#39;re expecting a foreign guest.</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.000" end="00:01:09.310" style="s2">You&#39;ll take care of the guest personally for three days.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.390" end="00:01:11.200" style="s2">Yes, Executive Director.</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.810" end="00:01:15.120" style="s2">Hải Phòng chỉ là giấy tờ thôi.<br />(Hai Phong is just a name on the paperwork.)</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.900" end="00:01:32.600" style="s2">在公海换船，改了船名，进南浦。<br />(They&#39;ll switch ships in international waters, rename the vessel, and enter Nampo.)</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.100" end="00:01:56.070" style="s2">It&#39;s not Hai Phong.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.150" end="00:01:58.120" style="s2">The cargo gets transferred at sea.</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.940" end="00:01:59.920" style="s2">Then it goes into Nampo.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.270" end="00:02:02.780" style="s2">Your evidence?</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.240" end="00:02:06.100" style="s2">The guest&#39;s phone call</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.930" end="00:02:08.500" style="s2">was recorded on the dashcam.</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.500" end="00:02:12.530" style="s2">Stay put for now.</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.940" end="00:02:18.430" style="s2">A recording of the call in the guest&#39;s car...</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.630" end="00:02:21.220" style="s2">I got a copy of it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.380" end="00:02:33.950" style="s2">Check the dashcam in the guest&#39;s car.</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.780" end="00:02:36.130" style="s2">Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.320" end="00:02:41.330" style="s2">The memory card in the company car&#39;s dashcam has been switched.</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.740" end="00:02:44.440" style="s2">Who was driving?</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.000" end="00:02:46.820" style="s2">Team Leader Hyun.</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.360" end="00:02:57.980" style="s2">I only reported it to Manager Seo.</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.720" end="00:03:01.070" style="s2">Two days later, someone was on my tail.</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.150" end="00:03:04.970" style="s2">I don&#39;t know if it&#39;s Manager Seo</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.970" end="00:03:06.070" style="s2">or someone above him.</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.540" end="00:03:09.210" style="s2">They&#39;re probably already planning to get rid of me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.740" end="00:03:17.210" style="s2">I&#39;ll investigate from the outside.</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.140" end="00:03:19.100" style="s2">You keep watch from within.</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.160" end="00:03:24.250" style="s2">Take care of our Junhee for me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.980" end="00:03:31.520" style="s2">Looks like I&#39;ll have to die once.</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.530" end="00:03:40.640" style="s2">Someone&#39;s been following me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.500" end="00:03:42.430" style="s2">Was that your order, Executive Director?</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.060" end="00:03:46.850" style="s2">Our Team Leader Hyun...</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.170" end="00:03:47.720" style="s2">Maybe you&#39;ve simply left</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.720" end="00:03:48.480" style="s2">too long a trail behind you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.920" end="00:03:52.950" style="s2">I&#39;ve taken out insurance.</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.840" end="00:03:55.900" style="s2">I&#39;m not dying alone.</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.290" end="00:04:03.120" style="s2">I&#39;m not bluffing.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.340" end="00:04:04.460" style="s2">I really made a copy.</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.920" end="00:04:08.300" style="s2">So if you disappear, it all comes out?</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.960" end="00:04:11.240" style="s2">Then you&#39;ll have to die of your own accord.</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.710" end="00:04:15.030" style="s2">First, give yourself a reason to die.</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.880" end="00:04:24.420" style="s2">You&#39;re back?</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.180" end="00:04:30.960" style="s2">Would you tell me if I asked why?</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.320" end="00:04:33.700" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.250" end="00:04:38.480" style="s2">I wanted to run away,</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.120" end="00:04:40.020" style="s2">but I couldn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.140" end="00:04:46.240" style="s2">I wanted to be angry,</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.990" end="00:04:49.390" style="s2">but I couldn&#39;t do that either.</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.720" end="00:04:52.200" style="s2">Then be angry.</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.820" end="00:05:01.850" style="s2">The food&#39;s getting cold.</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.700" end="00:05:10.280" style="s2">I&#39;ll do it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.230" end="00:05:12.890" style="s2">Let&#39;s do it together.</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.790" end="00:05:46.460" style="s2">I was thirsty.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.100" end="00:06:10.370" style="s2">It feels like this is the only house left on Earth.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.040" end="00:06:13.360" style="s2">On this enormous planet,</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.100" end="00:06:15.380" style="s2">it&#39;s just the two of us.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.560" end="00:06:19.350" style="s2">You&#39;re strange.</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.460" end="00:06:22.010" style="s2">Are we...</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.870" end="00:06:24.140" style="s2">sex partners?</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.790" end="00:06:28.370" style="s2">Do you want to be sex partners with me?</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.680" end="00:06:33.570" style="s2">I didn&#39;t know what else to call us,</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.020" end="00:06:34.880" style="s2">so I asked.</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.100" end="00:06:39.580" style="s2">We can be whatever you want.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.920" end="00:06:43.620" style="s2">What if I want something</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.450" end="00:06:45.420" style="s2">you don&#39;t want?</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.580" end="00:06:49.650" style="s2">Anything is fine with me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.450" end="00:06:53.770" style="s2">Then can I call you my boyfriend?</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.040" end="00:06:55.280" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.660" end="00:06:58.500" style="s2">What if I...</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.220" end="00:07:02.690" style="s2">said we mean nothing to each other,</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.590" end="00:07:04.900" style="s2">and I wanted to leave this place?</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.820" end="00:07:11.740" style="s2">That, I can&#39;t allow.</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.250" end="00:08:03.542" style="s2">7. Lovers</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
